SUMMARY:8 TO THE BAR Vocal Jazz\, Pop & Gospel Concert
DESCRIPTION:Jazz up your Sunday afternoon with an hour of popular jazz standards and more performed by local jazz choir 8 TO THE BAR\, featuring guest bassist George Koller\, Dr. Steven Webb on keys\, and Sheila Brand directing. Part of the Jazz & Reflection series\, pwyc $20 suggested.
