SUMMARY:Riverside Eats & Beats
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to taste the eats and feel the beats on Saturday\, June 6th\, 12pm-6pm at the 2026 Riverside Eats & Beats Streetfest! Spanning 10 vibrant blocks outdoors along Queen Street East between the Don Valley to just past the world-famous De Grassi Street. \nThis year\, the 12th Riverside Eats & Beats Streetfest\, hosted by the Riverside BIA will feature:\n*50+ local eateries and shops along Queen Street East serving food tasters\, sidewalk sales\, and specials\n*Destination points at five local street closures along Queen East and two local parks including local markets\, beer garden\, culinary delights\, family-friendly activities\, and entertainment\n*FREE activities: live music\, magic shows\, face-painting\, food/drink specials\, giveaways and more! \nQueen Street East will remain open throughout the festival. \nFREE TICKETS & RSVP for the Festival Guide with full details and schedule plus festival perks and promos: https://riverside-to.com/events/riverside-eats-beats-streetfest/
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/riverside-eats-beats/
LOCATION:Riverside\, Queen Street East between Davies and Empire Ave.\, Toronto
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/15182427/EatsBeats26-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
